+# Requirement and review checklist
+
+October30,2026; additive TEL02 source-structure unit. No source record or earlier report overwritten.
+
+| Requirement | Actual result / location | Verification and unresolved limits |
+|---|---|---|
+| Advance available evidence rather than blocked-input summaries | README; RESULTS; code | Newly parsed button SoundInfo, root stream/frame/sample fields and event-versus-stream bytes. FAA exact-accession search miss retained only locally. |
+| Keep previous evidence and conflicting fields | README comparison table; RESULTS | Prior long-resource hashes/counts and Ong2880-sample difference retained, with new stream counts/seek fields beside them. No chosen duration or cause. |
+| Source URL/hash/coordinate and actual scope | SOURCES | Two exact court ZIP members; eight selected reference pages visually read, selected p28 paragraph extracted. No full243-page or all12-SWF review. |
+| Falsifiable, reproducible comparison | compare_sound_controls.py; REPRODUCE | Actual outcome is byte nonidentity in each file; positive/negative parser controls passed. Same-file copies are dependent representations, not independent corroboration. |
+| Counterevidence and competing possibilities | README assessment; OPEN-TODOS | Re-encoding can alter bytes without changed intelligible content; different rate codes and matching header/first-block latency retained. Not a demonstrated explanation. |
+| Exact source-to-result relationships | RESULTS first/last blocks; SOURCES | Existing helper pinned to its verified public bytes; definition/button references checked. Full numeric output retained locally and reproducible; no runtime/control-purpose inference. |
+| Missing inputs and original goal remain intact | OPEN-TODOS | Native recordings/edit-export/custody/system/caller/clock joins open; all five tracks/eighteen substantive criteria unfinished. |
+| No duplicate assigned technical work | Protocol; OPEN-TODOS | Telephone presentation structure only; no flight recorder/materials/clock-owner tests repeated. |
+| Preserve originals and privacy boundaries | Native records; public candidate | No new audio decoding/listening, media output/upload, AS/Flash execution, outreach, mailbox, fees, new request, private push or deletion. Raw media/reference scans/contacts/personal data/private case material excluded. |
+| Revision accountability | REVISION.diff | Exact additive text/code/result diff against absent predecessor paths; prior published reports unchanged. |
+| Publication accountability | Actual Git/API receipts after push | Verify AveLyra account/author/committer, destination/SSH/ref and every remote file. Record review-branch versus main accurately. No publication claim from this checklist alone. |
+
+Structural checks cover JSON, source/helper/script hashes, fixture rejection, matched definition IDs, actual candidate/staged bytes and diff validity. They do not authenticate original callers, source production, missing inputs or historical conclusions. Portable candidate-run output must match the saved first result; actual verification receipt is separate.
