+# Original inputs and unperformed tests remain open
+
+October30,2026; AUD016-A1 / TC05-B105 / TC06-B110 / TEL02. Preserve the prior record gaps and count/field disputes. This supplement does not replace the five-track/eighteen-criterion plan.
+
+1. **TEL02 — source-to-presentation construction.** Obtain original/received recording identity, provenance/custody, edit/export project files, source/member mappings, authoring version/settings and any preparation worksheet or release manifest for these court assets. Presentations and filenames are not primary speaker authentication. Test whether event and stream objects derive from the same recording and retain contrary results.
+2. **TEL02 — semantic/runtime comparison, not yet performed.** A separately scoped local comparison could decode both representations and test waveform alignment, encoding rate, padding, crop boundaries and coverage, with independent controls and uncertainty. Preserve event counts, stream counts, seeking fields and originals before any transformation. No listening, new decoding, waveform alignment, playback, AS evaluation or historical-duration/clock claim was performed in this pass. A byte nonmatch does not distinguish re-encoding from a content difference.
+3. **TEL01–TEL04 — actual call/system evidence.** Native agency/release chain and complete delivery; interview originals/notes; usage-report attachments; carrier/operator dictionaries, event exports and clocks; operator/transfer/receiving-office legs; caller-to-row/exhibit-construction worksheets. Existing Keyton forms, usage-report representations and prior row tests remain held/performed, not relabeled missing. No Lyles/Ong asset result substitutes for AA77's particular zero-duration semantics or source-to-caller join.
+4. **FAA PD01–PD05 — unchanged substantive originals.** Corrected QFR plus delivery acknowledgment; signed consideration/action/no-action; distinct implementation/closure; applicable case classification/policy; accession NN3-237-09-007's actual transfer/acceptance and item manifest. One exact official-domain transfer query yielded no result; not evidence of absence or suppression, no repeated unchanged query.
+5. **REC/MAT/STL — preserve existing owners/dependencies.** No duplicate recorder/materials technical work or steel rehash. Full original-input plan and its eighteen criteria remain open; a file-structure result is not completion.
+
+Untested possibilities include equivalent content in different encodings, different exports/selected segments, unused event resources, action-driven runtime selection and other preparation differences. None is selected as the explanation. New source recordings, production records or an authorized concrete test input trigger revisit. No outreach, fee, request/filing, private publication, media upload or deletion is authorized by this queue.
